# glBSP Configuration Template
# This template configures glBSP, a utility for processing Doom WAD files.
# It generates a command-line invocation based on the provided options list.
# No variables are required; all configuration is driven by the 'options' list.

# Command to run glBSP with specified options.
# The 'options' list is flattened into a single space-separated string.
# Example options: ['-h', '-q', '-f', 'map.wad'] renders as: glbsp -h -q -f map.wad
glbsp {{ options | default([]) | join(' ') }}